* Model 3b  (gaussian-binomial)  I could also do  in case of a convergence problem
#y1 = a0+a1*x1 + u +  L   (i.e.,  lambda coeff is free)  # continuous
#y2 = b0 + b1*z1 + v  + L@1 (i.e.,  lambda is 1)   # binomial
