#y2 = b0 + b1*z1 + v  + L@1 (i.e.,  lambda is 1)   # binomial
#where L ~ N(0,1),  u ~ N(0,1), v ~ N(0,1); cor(u,v) = rho  Note:  u and v can have  unit variances for the bivariate probits or can be relaxed for other mixes.

