> > > y2 = b0 + b1*z1 + v  + L@a (i.e.,  lambda1*L)
> > > where L ~ N(0,1),  cor(u,v) = rho  Note:  u and v can have  unit variances for the bivariate probits or can be relaxed for other mixes.
