Subject: PC priors for Besagproper2 model
Message-ID: <oBShMCTS8WU.EGqIvaQ4AgAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/r-inla-discussion-group/c/oBShMCTS8WU/m/EGqIvaQ4AgAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi,

I want to compute the joint PC prior for the Besagproper2 model. And I think the precision tau already has a closed form as a type-2 Gumbel distribution. Then, how to compute the density of the mixing parameter phi? Also, I am assuming that the joint prior can be multipled by these two prior densities?

Thanks,
B

From u66ed4f72a898a51c at groups.google.com  Thu Jun 16 06:28:03 2022
From: u66ed4f72a898a51c at groups.google.com (Elias T. Krainski)
